[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――１年前",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—One Year Ago"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "字幕",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caption"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここが氷霜の地……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is the Frostlands..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この辺りはもう王国領の外なんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're already outside kingdom territory, aren't we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。この場所は我がララ・キングダムのお膝元ですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. You now stand at the doorstep of my kingdom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、ララ・キングダムってこの近くにあるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, the Kingdom of Lara is nearby?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちが素材を採っても大丈夫なんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it really okay for us to gather materials from this region?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "構いませんわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大海を渡る船を造るのですから、できうる限り\n最高の素材を集めねばなりませんもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To build a ship capable of crossing the great sea, we must gather only the finest materials available."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、参りましょう。\n王直々にご案内いたしますわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, shall we proceed? As queen, I shall personally guide you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます、ララさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much, Miss Lara!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一緒に頑張りましょうね、ヴァレリアさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do our best, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。どんどん採っちゃうわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right. Let's grab everything we can."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、その虫も貴重な素材です。幸先が良いですわね。\n王が案内しているゆえ、幸運も寄ってくると",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, that insect is quite a useful material. How fortuitous. Where a queen goes, good fortune naturally follows."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なるほど。よーし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I see. Alright then..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、虫苦手だったよね？\nそういうのは相棒に任せときなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, weren't you scared of bugs? Why don't you let Valeria handle those?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、私も頑張らないと！\u3000\n粉骨砕身！\u3000や……やーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I have to do my part! H-here goes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うぇぇ……な、なんとか捕まえられたぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I... I managed to catch it somehow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, are you alright?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ありがとう……でも、大丈夫だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thanks... but I'm fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "苦手な敵と戦った後なんだから、\nちょっと甘えたってバチは当たらないよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After what happened, nobody would blame you for taking it easy, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無数島群域を目指して旅をするというのに、\nこのくらいのことで甘えてはいられませんから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're about to journey to the Infinite Island Chain. I can't go easy on myself over something like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "以前、私の虫嫌いのせいで皆さんに迷惑をかけて\nしまったこともありましたし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, my fear of bugs has already caused enough trouble for everyone before..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、そうなんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, is that so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。向上心は大切ですが、弱点は誰しも持つもの。\n恥ではありませんわよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My my. While ambition is admirable, everyone has their weaknesses. There's no shame in that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But still..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――何か来るわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something's coming."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この辺りを縄張りにしている魔物のようですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seems to be the monsters that claim this territory as their own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本命の素材はこの先にあります。\n王の号令のもと、さっさと蹴散らしますわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The materials we seek lie ahead. By royal decree, let us make quick work of these nuisances!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]